1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,580
Some work needs a screen.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,862
Like Blender, or Marvelous Designer.

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,770
Give your agent a dedicated work screen.

4
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:13,090
Create a virtual display with yomado,

5
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,581
and name it Codex.

6
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:21,530
Drag in the apps it needs.

7
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,010
Blender. Marvelous Designer.

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,981
Your other windows stay where they are.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,420
The agent reads screenshots,

10
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,500
clicks controls, and types.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,140
It works through the interface,

12
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:40,094
even without an app-specific MCP integration.

13
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,160
Add another screen for GrokBot.

14
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,040
Bring apps back when you need them,

15
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,329
then close the screen.

16
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,880
yomado. For visual agents.

17
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,919
Download at yomado.app.
